---
import CaseStudy from '../../layouts/CaseStudy.astro';
---
<CaseStudy slug="infinity">
  <Fragment slot="meta">
    <div class="cs-meta-card">
      <div class="cs-meta-row"><div class="cs-meta-label">Role</div><div class="cs-meta-value">Creative Director</div></div>
      <div class="cs-meta-row"><div class="cs-meta-label">Company</div><div class="cs-meta-value">Infinity Lifestyle Brands</div></div>
      <div class="cs-meta-row"><div class="cs-meta-label">Duration</div><div class="cs-meta-value">2018–2019</div></div>
      <div class="cs-meta-row"><div class="cs-meta-label">Industry</div><div class="cs-meta-value">Licensed Consumer Products</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-strip">
      <div class="stat-box">
        <div class="stat-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="12" y1="2" x2="12" y2="22"/><path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"/></svg></div>
        <div class="stat-num">$10M+</div>
        <div class="stat-label">in licensing contracts supported</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-box">
        <div class="stat-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="16.5" y1="9.4" x2="7.5" y2="4.21"/><path d="M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z"/><polyline points="3.27 6.96 12 12.01 20.73 6.96"/><line x1="12" y1="22.08" x2="12" y2="12"/></svg></div>
        <div class="stat-num">50+</div>
        <div class="stat-label">SKUs designed and deployed</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-box">
        <div class="stat-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg></div>
        <div class="stat-num">1.5M+</div>
        <div class="stat-label">labels QC'd across global production</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="media-video infinity-video infinity-promo-video">
      <video src="/Images/Infinity/Gleyber-Torres-SportsWater-promo.mp4" poster="/Images/Infinity/sportswater-promo-poster.jpg" controls playsinline preload="metadata"></video>
    </div>
    <div class="infinity-car-block">
    <div class="car-grid">
      <div class="car-sidebar">
        <div class="car-step active" onclick="switchCar(this,'car-infinity-1')"><div class="car-step-label">01 · Context</div><div class="car-step-title">The situation</div></div>
        <div class="car-step" onclick="switchCar(this,'car-infinity-2')"><div class="car-step-label">02 · Action</div><div class="car-step-title">What I did</div></div>
        <div class="car-step" onclick="switchCar(this,'car-infinity-3')"><div class="car-step-label">03 · Result</div><div class="car-step-title">The outcome</div></div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div id="car-infinity-1" class="car-content">
          <div class="car-content-label">01 · Context</div>
          <div class="car-content-title">Two licensing partnerships, ambitions for many more, and a brand that couldn't carry them.</div>
          <div class="car-content-body">Sports Water was a licensed bottled water brand operated by Infinity Lifestyle Brands. When I came on, the company had two licensing partnerships (the New York Yankees and Boston Red Sox) and ambitions to scale far beyond them.<br /><br />But the brand wasn't ready. The logo was dated, the marketing leaned entirely on the licensed IP to sell, and the sales materials were a patchwork deck stitched together over years. That was enough for two baseball partnerships, but landing Disney, Viacom, and the MLBPA required a brand that could survive corporate licensor review, hold its own against Propel, LIFEWTR, and Smartwater on shelf, and give the sales team creative that actually closed deals.</div>
        </div>
        <div id="car-infinity-2" class="car-content" style="display:none">
          <div class="car-content-label">02 · Action</div>
          <div class="car-content-title">Rebuilt the brand, the commercial toolkit, and the production pipeline.</div>
          <div class="car-content-body">Rebuilt Sports Water from the ground up. Modernized the Running Man icon: inverted the figure, added a dynamic swoosh element, introduced a two-color system (Sports Navy + Aqua Teal), and sheared the wordmark to convey motion. Defined the full type system (Bebas Neue for headlines, Archivo for subheads and body) and brand standards.<br /><br />Built the complete commercial toolkit: packaging architecture for every licensed property, retail-ready label artwork across 50+ SKUs, a modular sales presentation the team could customize per prospect, in-stadium signage, POP displays, trade show booth assets, experiential event creative, and a revamped social media presence across Instagram, Twitter, and Facebook.<br /><br />Managed label production and QC across 1.5M+ units from bottling plants in California, Pennsylvania, Tennessee, Wisconsin, Ireland, and Mexico, ensuring brand consistency and compliance across every run. Oversaw a $650K creative production budget.<br /><br />Worked directly with licensor teams on approval workflows, including an in-person session at Viacom's offices to align on Nickelodeon print layout.</div>
        </div>
        <div id="car-infinity-3" class="car-content" style="display:none">
          <div class="car-content-label">03 · Result</div>
          <div class="car-content-title">$10M+ in licensing contracts closed. 50+ SKUs at retail. 1.5M+ labels through QC.</div>
          <div class="car-content-body">The overhauled brand system, packaging, and sales materials became the toolkit that opened doors the old brand couldn't. After the rebrand, Infinity closed exclusive partnerships exceeding $10M, adding Disney, Viacom (Nickelodeon, Paw Patrol), MLBPA, the Las Vegas Raiders, Jacksonville Jaguars, St. Louis Cardinals, Manchester City, and Liverpool FC. Every pitch used creative I built.<br /><br />50+ SKUs shipped to retail with unified brand direction. The packaging system accommodated each licensor's unique style guide while maintaining a recognizable Sports Water identity at shelf. 1.5M+ labels cleared QC across global production with zero major recalls.<br /><br />The methodology developed here, reconciling multiple licensor guidelines into one coherent brand system at production scale, became the operating playbook I carried into multi-state regulated packaging at Scandalous Chocolates.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    </div>
  </Fragment>

  <div class="section">
    <div class="section-label">Brand System</div>
    <div class="infinity-logo-wrap">
      <div class="infinity-logo-cell infinity-logo-cell-logo">
        <img src="/Images/Infinity/Text%20logo%20white.png" alt="Sports Water wordmark" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <div class="infinity-logo-cell infinity-logo-cell-stacked">
        <img src="/Images/Infinity/SW%20Logo%20white.png" alt="Sports Water stacked primary lockup" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <div class="infinity-logo-cell infinity-logo-cell-icon">
        <img src="/Images/Infinity/Running%20Man%20White.png" alt="Sports Water Running Man icon" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <div class="infinity-logo-cell infinity-logo-cell-horizontal">
        <img src="/Images/Infinity/Horizontal%20lockup%20logo%20white.png" alt="Sports Water horizontal lockup" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="brand-system" style="margin-top:14px">
      <div class="brand-swatches">
        <div class="brand-swatch">
          <div class="swatch-chip" style="background:#0C2340"></div>
          <div class="swatch-name">Sports Navy</div>
          <div class="swatch-meta">PMS 289c</div>
          <div class="swatch-meta">HEX #0C2340</div>
          <div class="swatch-meta">RGB 12 · 35 · 64</div>
          <div class="swatch-meta">CMYK 100 · 76 · 12 · 70</div>
        </div>
        <div class="brand-swatch">
          <div class="swatch-chip" style="background:#53CAEC"></div>
          <div class="swatch-name">Aqua Teal</div>
          <div class="swatch-meta">PMS 305c</div>
          <div class="swatch-meta">HEX #53CAEC</div>
          <div class="swatch-meta">RGB 83 · 202 · 236</div>
          <div class="swatch-meta">CMYK 54 · 0 · 10 · 0</div>
        </div>
        <div class="brand-swatch">
          <div class="swatch-chip swatch-chip-white" style="background:#FFFFFF"></div>
          <div class="swatch-name">White</div>
          <div class="swatch-meta">HEX #FFFFFF</div>
          <div class="swatch-meta">RGB 255 · 255 · 255</div>
          <div class="swatch-meta">CMYK 0 · 0 · 0 · 0</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="brand-type">
        <div class="type-row">
          <div class="type-meta">
            <div class="type-name">Bebas Neue</div>
            <div class="type-role">Headlines · 15° skew</div>
          </div>
          <div class="type-sample type-sample-headline">
            <div class="type-marquee">
              <span class="type-marquee-content">ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ 1234567890&nbsp;&nbsp;·&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>
              <span class="type-marquee-content" aria-hidden="true">ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ 1234567890&nbsp;&nbsp;·&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="type-row">
          <div class="type-meta">
            <div class="type-name">Archivo Black</div>
            <div class="type-role">Sub header</div>
          </div>
          <div class="type-sample type-sample-subhead">
            <div class="type-marquee">
              <span class="type-marquee-content">ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz 1234567890&nbsp;&nbsp;·&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>
              <span class="type-marquee-content" aria-hidden="true">ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz 1234567890&nbsp;&nbsp;·&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="type-row">
          <div class="type-meta">
            <div class="type-name">Archivo</div>
            <div class="type-role">Body copy</div>
          </div>
          <div class="type-sample type-sample-body">
            <div class="type-marquee">
              <span class="type-marquee-content">ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz 1234567890&nbsp;&nbsp;·&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>
              <span class="type-marquee-content" aria-hidden="true">ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz 1234567890&nbsp;&nbsp;·&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top:14px">
    <div class="section-label">Promo Events</div>
    <div class="media-video infinity-video">
      <video src="/Images/Infinity/Gleyber-Torres-Modells.mp4" poster="/Images/Infinity/sportswater-promoevents-poster.jpg" controls playsinline preload="metadata"></video>
    </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top:14px">
    <div class="section-label">In Venue</div>
    <div class="media-video infinity-video">
      <video src="/Images/Infinity/SportsWater-Suite-Night-Yankees.mp4" poster="/Images/Infinity/sportswater-invenue-poster.jpg" controls playsinline preload="metadata"></video>
    </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top:14px">
    <div class="section-label">Selected work</div>
    <div class="media-stack">
      <figure class="media-figure">
        <img src="/Images/Infinity/infinity-before-after.jpg" alt="Sports Water brand before and after rebrand comparison" loading="lazy" />
        <figcaption class="media-caption">Before &amp; After</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="media-figure">
        <img src="/Images/Infinity/infinity-brand-system.jpg" alt="Sports Water logo system, typography, and color palette" loading="lazy" />
        <figcaption class="media-caption">Brand Identity</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="media-figure">
        <img src="/Images/Infinity/infinity-yankees-packaging.jpg" alt="New York Yankees Sports Water bottle — four-angle packaging view" loading="lazy" />
        <figcaption class="media-caption">Packaging — Yankees</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="media-figure">
        <img src="/Images/Infinity/infinity-sku-lineup.jpg" alt="Full Sports Water SKU lineup across all licensed properties" loading="lazy" />
        <figcaption class="media-caption">Full SKU Range</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="media-figure">
        <img src="/Images/Infinity/infinity-stadium-signage.jpg" alt="Sports Water in-stadium signage at Yankee Stadium and Busch Stadium" loading="lazy" />
        <figcaption class="media-caption">In-Venue Signage</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="media-figure">
        <img src="/Images/Infinity/infinity-experiential.jpg" alt="Sports Water trade show booth and event activations" loading="lazy" />
        <figcaption class="media-caption">Events &amp; Experiential</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="media-figure">
        <img src="/Images/Infinity/infinity-sales-deck.jpg" alt="Rebuilt Sports Water sales presentation overview" loading="lazy" />
        <figcaption class="media-caption">Sales Collateral</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <div class="section-label">Key Insight</div>
    <div class="foundation-card key-insight" style="border:none;background:transparent;padding:0">
      <div class="foundation-section-title">The hardest problem wasn't design — it was credibility.</div>
      <div class="foundation-desc">Building a brand system credible enough to get in the room with Disney and the MLBPA in the first place was the actual problem. The Yankees and Red Sox proved the concept; the rebrand proved the brand could scale.</div>
      <div class="foundation-desc" style="margin-bottom:0">Every new partnership after that — Nickelodeon, the Raiders, Manchester City — was closed using materials I created.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</CaseStudy>

<style>
  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bebas+Neue&family=Archivo:wght@400;500&family=Archivo+Black&display=swap');

  .infinity-video{max-width:100%}
  .infinity-promo-video{margin-top:14px}
  .infinity-car-block{margin-top:14px}

  .infinity-logo-wrap{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(12,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px;align-items:stretch}
  .infinity-logo-cell{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:#0C2340;border-radius:var(--r-lg);padding:5%}
  .infinity-logo-cell img{display:block;height:auto;width:auto;max-width:90%;max-height:100%;object-fit:contain}
  .infinity-logo-cell-horizontal{grid-column:1 / -1;order:1}
  .infinity-logo-cell-horizontal img{height:110px}
  .infinity-logo-cell-stacked{grid-column:span 3;order:2}
  .infinity-logo-cell-stacked img{height:108px}
  .infinity-logo-cell-icon{grid-column:span 3;order:3}
  .infinity-logo-cell-logo{grid-column:span 6;order:4}
  .infinity-logo-cell-logo img{height:120px}
  @media (max-width:640px){
    .infinity-logo-wrap{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:8px}
    .infinity-logo-cell{padding:8px;min-width:0;box-sizing:border-box;overflow:hidden}
    .infinity-logo-cell-horizontal{order:1;grid-column:1 / -1;aspect-ratio:5 / 1.21;padding:5px 8px}
    .infinity-logo-cell-stacked{order:2;grid-column:span 1;aspect-ratio:1 / 1}
    .infinity-logo-cell-icon{order:3;grid-column:span 1;aspect-ratio:1 / 1}
    .infinity-logo-cell-logo{order:4;grid-column:1 / -1;aspect-ratio:5 / 2}
    .infinity-logo-cell img{height:auto;width:auto;max-height:70%;max-width:85%;object-fit:contain}
    .infinity-logo-cell-logo img{max-height:81%;max-width:100%}
    .infinity-logo-cell-horizontal img{max-height:88%;max-width:93%}
    .infinity-logo-cell-stacked img{max-height:75%;max-width:91%}
  }

  .brand-system{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:32px;background:var(--bg2);border-radius:var(--r-lg);padding:28px}
  .brand-swatches{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:8px}
  .brand-swatch{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:2px}
  .swatch-chip{width:100%;aspect-ratio:3/2;max-width:160px;border-radius:var(--r);border:1px solid var(--border);margin-bottom:6px}
  .swatch-chip-white{border-color:var(--border2)}
  .swatch-name{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text);margin-top:4px}
  .swatch-meta{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:10px;color:var(--text3);letter-spacing:.04em}

  .brand-type{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding-top:24px}
  .type-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(140px,180px) minmax(0,1fr);gap:20px;align-items:baseline;padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
  .type-row:last-child{border-bottom:none;padding-bottom:0}
  .type-meta{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px}
  .type-name{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text)}
  .type-role{font-size:10px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;color:var(--text3)}
  .type-sample{font-size:18px;line-height:1.3;color:var(--text);overflow:hidden;width:100%;min-width:0}
  .type-marquee{display:inline-flex;white-space:nowrap;animation:type-marquee 40s linear infinite;will-change:transform}
  .type-marquee-content{display:inline-block;flex-shrink:0}
  .type-sample:hover .type-marquee{animation-play-state:paused}
  @keyframes type-marquee{0%{transform:translateX(0)}100%{transform:translateX(-50%)}}
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
    .type-marquee{animation:none}
  }
  .type-sample-headline{font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-size:30px;letter-spacing:.02em;transform:skewX(-15deg);transform-origin:left center}
  .type-sample-subhead{font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;font-size:18px;letter-spacing:.01em}
  .type-sample-body{font-family:'Archivo',sans-serif;font-weight:400;font-size:17px;letter-spacing:.01em}

  @media (max-width:640px){
    .brand-swatches{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:6px}
    .swatch-chip{max-width:100%}
    .type-row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:6px}
    .type-sample-headline{font-size:24px}
  }
</style>
